@startuml 使用案例6_2: 通知管理
title 使用案例6.2: 通知管理流程

actor 使用者 as User
participant "NotificationCenter.vue" as Center
participant "useNotifications.ts" as Composable
participant "client.ts\" as API
participant "notifications.py\n(blueprint)" as Blueprint
participant "notification_service.py" as Service
participant "others.py(Notification)(model)" as NotificationModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== Stage 1: 進入通知中心頁面 ==
User -> Center: 訪問 /notifications
activate Center
Center -> Center: 初始化頁面狀態\n- currentFilter = 'all'\n- loading = true

== Stage 2: 載入完整通知列表 ==
Center -> Composable: fetchNotifications()
activate Composable
Composable -> API: GET /notifications
activate API
API -> Blueprint: GET /notifications
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證 JWT token
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 從 token 取得 current_user_id

== Stage 3: 查詢使用者所有通知 ==
Blueprint -> Service: list_notifications(\nuser_id=current_user_id,\nread_filter=None,\npage=1,\nper_page=50\n)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢所有通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\nWHERE recipient_id=?\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 50 OFFSET 0
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: notifications records
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: notifications[]\n(含 type, payload, read, created_at, read_at)
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: 組裝回應資料\n- 計算總頁數\n- 包含分頁資訊
Service --> Blueprint: {notifications[], total, page, per_page, pages}
deactivate Service

== Stage 4: 回傳通知列表 ==
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {notifications[], total}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: notifications[]
deactivate API
Composable -> Composable: notifications.value = notifications[]\nunreadCount = notifications.filter(n => !n.read).length
Composable --> Center: notifications[]
deactivate Composable

== Stage 5: 渲染通知中心介面 ==
Center -> Center: 計算統計資料\n- 全部通知: notifications.length\n- 未讀通知: unreadCount\n- 已讀通知: readNotifications.length

Center -> Center: 渲染篩選標籤\n- 全部 (N)\n- 未讀 (M)\n- 已讀 (K)

Center -> Center: 渲染通知列表\n- 根據 currentFilter 篩選\n- 未讀通知顯示藍色左邊框\n- 顯示通知圖示、標題、訊息\n- 顯示相對時間\n- 顯示操作按鈕 (標記已讀/刪除)

Center -> Center: loading = false
Center --> User: 顯示通知中心\n- 統計卡片\n- 篩選標籤\n- 通知列表
deactivate Center

== Stage 6: 啟動輪詢機制 ==
Center -> Composable: startPolling()\n啟動 30 秒輪詢
activate Composable
Composable -> Composable: 設定定時器\nsetInterval(fetchUnreadCount, 30000)
deactivate Composable

note over Center, Composable
輪詢會持續在背景更新未讀數量
直到使用者離開頁面 (onUnmounted)
end note

== Stage 7: 使用者操作選擇 ==
note over User, Center
使用者可以執行以下操作:
1. 切換篩選標籤 (全部/未讀/已讀)
2. 點擊「全部標為已讀」按鈕
3. 點擊單一通知標記為已讀
4. 點擊刪除按鈕刪除通知
5. 點擊通知項目查看詳情
end note

alt 操作 1: 切換篩選標籤

== Stage 8a: 切換到未讀標籤 ==
User -> Center: 點擊「未讀」標籤
activate Center
Center -> Center: currentFilter = 'unread'
Center -> Center: filteredNotifications = computed(() => {\n  return unreadNotifications.value\n})
Center -> Center: 重新渲染列表\n只顯示未讀通知
Center --> User: 顯示未讀通知列表
deactivate Center

note over Center
篩選邏輯 (computed):
- 'all': 顯示所有通知
- 'unread': 只顯示 read=false 的通知
- 'read': 只顯示 read=true 的通知

篩選在前端進行，無需重新請求 API
end note

else 操作 2: 全部標為已讀

== Stage 8b: 執行全部標為已讀 ==
User -> Center: 點擊「全部標為已讀」按鈕
activate Center
Center -> Composable: markAllAsRead()
activate Composable
Composable -> API: POST /notifications/mark-all-read
activate API
API -> Blueprint: POST /notifications/mark-all-read
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 取得 current_user_id

== Stage 9b: 批次更新通知狀態 ==
Blueprint -> Service: mark_all_as_read(user_id)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 批次更新通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: UPDATE notifications\nSET read=True, read_at=NOW()\nWHERE recipient_id=?\nAND read=False
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: updated_count
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: updated_count
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: db.session.commit()
Service --> Blueprint: updated_count
deactivate Service

== Stage 10b: 回傳結果並更新本地狀態 ==
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {message, updated_count}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: {updated_count}
deactivate API

Composable -> Composable: 更新本地狀態\n- notifications.forEach(n => n.read = true)\n- unreadCount = 0
Composable --> Center: success
deactivate Composable

Center -> Center: 重新渲染列表\n- 所有通知移除藍色邊框\n- 隱藏「標記已讀」按鈕\n- 更新統計卡片
Center --> User: 顯示「已全部標為已讀」\n所有通知變為已讀狀態
deactivate Center

else 操作 3: 標記單一通知為已讀

== Stage 8c: 標記單一通知 ==
User -> Center: 點擊通知的「標記已讀」按鈕
activate Center
Center -> Composable: markAsRead(notification_id)
activate Composable
Composable -> API: POST /notifications/{id}/mark-read
activate API
API -> Blueprint: POST /notifications/{notification_id}/mark-read
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 取得 current_user_id

== Stage 9c: 更新單一通知狀態 ==
Blueprint -> Service: mark_as_read(notification_id, user_id)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\nWHERE notification_id=?\nAND recipient_id=?
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: notification record
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: notification
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: 驗證權限\nIF notification不存在:\nraise ValueError('通知不存在')

Service -> NotificationModel: 更新通知狀態
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: UPDATE notifications\nSET read=True, read_at=NOW()\nWHERE notification_id=?
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: success
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: success
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: db.session.commit()
Service --> Blueprint: notification (read=True, read_at)
deactivate Service

== Stage 10c: 更新本地狀態 ==
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {notification}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: notification
deactivate API

Composable -> Composable: 更新本地狀態\n- notifications[index] = updated\n- unreadCount -= 1
Composable --> Center: success
deactivate Composable

Center -> Center: 重新渲染通知\n- 移除藍色邊框\n- 隱藏「標記已讀」按鈕\n- 更新統計卡片
Center --> User: 通知標記為已讀
deactivate Center

else 操作 4: 刪除通知

== Stage 8d: 執行刪除操作 ==
User -> Center: 點擊通知的「刪除」按鈕
activate Center
Center -> Composable: deleteNotification(notification_id)
activate Composable
Composable -> API: DELETE /notifications/{id}
activate API
API -> Blueprint: DELETE /notifications/{notification_id}
activate Blueprint
Blueprint -> Blueprint: @jwt_required() 驗證
Blueprint -> Blueprint: 取得 current_user_id

== Stage 9d: 刪除通知資料 ==
Blueprint -> Service: delete_notification(notification_id, user_id)
activate Service
Service -> NotificationModel: 查詢通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\nWHERE notification_id=?\nAND recipient_id=?
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: notification record
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: notification
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: 驗證權限\nIF notification不存在:\nraise ValueError('通知不存在')

Service -> NotificationModel: 刪除通知
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: DELETE FROM notifications\nWHERE notification_id=?
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: success
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> Service: success
deactivate NotificationModel

Service -> Service: db.session.commit()
Service --> Blueprint: success
deactivate Service

== Stage 10d: 更新本地狀態 ==
Blueprint --> API: 200 OK {message: '通知已刪除'}
deactivate Blueprint
API --> Composable: success
deactivate API

Composable -> Composable: 從本地列表移除\n- notifications.splice(index, 1)\n- 若未讀則 unreadCount -= 1
Composable --> Center: success
deactivate Composable

Center -> Center: 重新渲染列表\n- 移除該通知項目\n- 更新統計卡片\n- 若列表為空顯示空狀態
Center --> User: 通知已刪除
deactivate Center

else 操作 5: 點擊通知查看詳情

== Stage 8e: 點擊通知項目 ==
User -> Center: 點擊通知項目
activate Center
Center -> Center: handleNotificationClick(notification)

alt 通知未讀
    Center -> Composable: markAsRead(notification_id)
    activate Composable
    Composable -> API: POST /notifications/{id}/mark-read
    activate API
    API -> Blueprint: POST /notifications/{notification_id}/mark-read
    activate Blueprint
    Blueprint -> Service: mark_as_read(notification_id, user_id)
    activate Service
    Service -> NotificationModel: 更新通知狀態
    activate NotificationModel
    NotificationModel -> DB: UPDATE notifications SET read=True, read_at=NOW()
    activate DB
    DB --> NotificationModel: success
    deactivate DB
    NotificationModel --> Service: success
    deactivate NotificationModel
    Service --> Blueprint: notification
    deactivate Service
    Blueprint --> API: 200 OK
    deactivate Blueprint
    API --> Composable: notification
    deactivate API
    Composable --> Center: success
    deactivate Composable
end

Center -> Center: 根據通知類型導航\n(TODO: 實現導航邏輯)

note over Center
導航邏輯 (待實現):
- application_submitted → /my-applications
- application_approved → /animals/{animal_id}
- application_rejected → /my-applications
- animal_status_changed → /animals/{animal_id}
- rehome_application_received → /application-review
- system_notification → 不導航
end note

Center --> User: 導航至相關頁面
deactivate Center

end

== Stage 11: 錯誤處理 ==
note over Center, Service
可能的錯誤情況:
1. 401 Unauthorized: JWT token 無效或過期
   → 重導向到登入頁
   
2. 404 Not Found: 通知不存在
   → 顯示「通知不存在」並重新載入列表
   
3. 403 Forbidden: 嘗試操作他人的通知
   → 顯示「無權限操作此通知」
   
4. 500 Internal Server Error: 資料庫錯誤
   → 顯示「操作失敗，請稍後再試」

錯誤處理流程:
- try-catch 包裹所有操作
- console.error 記錄錯誤
- 顯示用戶友好的錯誤訊息
- 重新載入通知列表
end note

== Stage 12: 通知類型與圖示系統 ==
note over Center
通知類型對應 (7種):

1. application_submitted (藍色)
   - 標題: 「領養申請已提交」
   - 圖示: 文件圖示
   - 訊息: 「您的申請已提交：{動物名}」

2. application_approved (綠色)
   - 標題: 「領養申請已通過」
   - 圖示: 勾選圖示
   - 訊息: 「您的申請已通過：{動物名}」

3. application_rejected (紅色)
   - 標題: 「領養申請未通過」
   - 圖示: X 圖示
   - 訊息: 「您的申請已被拒絕：{動物名}」

4. application_under_review (黃色)
   - 標題: 「領養申請審核中」
   - 圖示: 時鐘圖示
   - 訊息: 審核者資訊

5. rehome_application_received (紫色)
   - 標題: 「收到新的領養申請」
   - 圖示: 信封圖示
   - 訊息: 申請人資訊

6. animal_status_changed (靛藍色)
   - 標題: 「動物狀態更新」
   - 圖示: 鈴鐺圖示
   - 訊息: 狀態變更資訊

7. system_notification (灰色)
   - 標題: 「系統通知」
   - 圖示: 資訊圖示
   - 訊息: 自訂訊息
end note

== Stage 13: 篩選與統計功能 ==
note over Center
篩選標籤功能:
1. 全部標籤
   - 顯示所有通知
   - 數量: notifications.length
   
2. 未讀標籤
   - 只顯示 read=false 的通知
   - 數量: unreadNotifications.length
   - 過濾邏輯: notifications.filter(n => !n.read)
   
3. 已讀標籤
   - 只顯示 read=true 的通知
   - 數量: readNotifications.length
   - 過濾邏輯: notifications.filter(n => n.read)

統計卡片:
1. 全部通知卡片 (藍色圖示)
   - 顯示總通知數量
   
2. 未讀通知卡片 (紅色圖示)
   - 顯示未讀數量
   - 若 > 0 則顯示「全部標為已讀」按鈕
   
3. 已讀通知卡片 (綠色圖示)
   - 顯示已讀數量

實時更新:
- 標記已讀/刪除後自動更新統計
- 輪詢機制持續更新未讀數量
- Computed 屬性自動重新計算
end note

== Stage 14: 通知列表渲染規則 ==
note over Center
通知項目顯示規則:

1. 未讀通知:
   - 左邊框: 藍色 4px (border-l-4 border-indigo-600)
   - 未讀徽章: 顯示「未讀」標籤
   - 標題顏色: 深灰 (text-gray-900)
   - 操作按鈕: 顯示「標記已讀」和「刪除」

2. 已讀通知:
   - 左邊框: 無
   - 未讀徽章: 隱藏
   - 標題顏色: 中灰 (text-gray-600)
   - 操作按鈕: 只顯示「刪除」

3. 通知圖示:
   - 圓形背景 (h-12 w-12)
   - 顏色根據類型 (bg-blue-500, bg-green-500, etc.)
   - SVG 圖示 (h-6 w-6, text-white)

4. 懸停效果:
   - 陰影增強 (hover:shadow-md)
   - 游標變為指針 (cursor-pointer)
   - 按鈕背景變色

5. 空狀態:
   - 圖示: 鈴鐺 SVG (h-16 w-16, text-gray-400)
   - 訊息: 根據篩選顯示不同文字
   - 「未讀」篩選: "所有通知都已讀取"
   - 其他: "您目前沒有任何通知"
end note

== Stage 15: 生命週期管理 ==
note over Center, Composable
onMounted:
1. fetchNotifications() - 載入通知列表
2. startPolling() - 啟動輪詢機制
   - 設定 setInterval(fetchUnreadCount, 30000)
   - 每 30 秒更新未讀數量

onUnmounted:
1. stopPolling() - 停止輪詢
   - clearInterval(pollTimer)
   - 釋放定時器資源

Computed Properties:
1. filteredNotifications
   - 根據 currentFilter 動態過濾
   - 自動響應 currentFilter 變化

2. unreadNotifications
   - 過濾 read=false 的通知
   - 用於未讀標籤

3. readNotifications
   - 過濾 read=true 的通知
   - 用於已讀標籤
end note

@enduml